        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;When nightclub sensation Velma murders her philandering husband, Chicago’s slickest lawyer Billy Flynn is set to defend her. But when Roxie also winds up in prison, Billy takes on her case too and turns her into a media sensation. The two death-row murderesses develop a fierce rivalry while competing for publicity, celebrity, and a sleazy...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
